# Docker does not read .gitignore, and the build does `COPY . .`. Without this
# file every local secret and database in the checkout is uploaded into the
# build context and can persist in builder cache layers even though the final
# distroless image does not contain them.
#
# An allowlist, so a file added later is excluded until someone says otherwise.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!assets/
!db/
!queries.read.sql
!queries.write.sql
!tmp/
tmp/*
!tmp/starterkit-amd64

# Reachable through the allowlist above, and none of it belongs in an image.
assets/ui/**/-/
**/node_modules/
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/.env
**/.env.*
